      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1887, the Fremont, Elkhorn and Missouri Valley Railroad built a depot in Surprise, sparking rapid business growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2",
